{"4587130":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Green Field Cube Island","steam_appid":4587130,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5025900],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Chodnii, and you must escape Cube Island.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/f1c7d26f8c30b6922c22df6e8da54cdc.poster.avif?t=1793755280\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/f1c7d26f8c30b6922c22df6e8da54cdc.webm?t=1793755280\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/f1c7d26f8c30b6922c22df6e8da54cdc.mp4?t=1793755280\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use normal attacks, spirit skills, and god skills, while also jumping and dodging to outmaneuver your enemies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/4f73e357a2bc8a83654323d83a97157f.poster.avif?t=1793755280\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/4f73e357a2bc8a83654323d83a97157f.webm?t=1793755280\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/4f73e357a2bc8a83654323d83a97157f.mp4?t=1793755280\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirit skills and god skills are powerful attack abilities. Every time you clear a portal, you can get new spirit skills and god skills — and even unlock the second kind of combat modes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/a3d4b874e32652fc136ecb5fa50664c6.poster.avif?t=1793755280\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/a3d4b874e32652fc136ecb5fa50664c6.webm?t=1793755280\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/a3d4b874e32652fc136ecb5fa50664c6.mp4?t=1793755280\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies are immensely powerful, but with your skill and determination, you will overcome them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/04f835e4a8b8835bc837e5ed3b4de7cc.poster.avif?t=1793755280\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/04f835e4a8b8835bc837e5ed3b4de7cc.webm?t=1793755280\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/04f835e4a8b8835bc837e5ed3b4de7cc.mp4?t=1793755280\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Chodnii, and you must escape Cube Island.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/f1c7d26f8c30b6922c22df6e8da54cdc.poster.avif?t=1793755280\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/f1c7d26f8c30b6922c22df6e8da54cdc.webm?t=1793755280\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/f1c7d26f8c30b6922c22df6e8da54cdc.mp4?t=1793755280\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use normal attacks, spirit skills, and god skills, while also jumping and dodging to outmaneuver your enemies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/4f73e357a2bc8a83654323d83a97157f.poster.avif?t=1793755280\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/4f73e357a2bc8a83654323d83a97157f.webm?t=1793755280\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/4f73e357a2bc8a83654323d83a97157f.mp4?t=1793755280\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirit skills and god skills are powerful attack abilities. Every time you clear a portal, you can get new spirit skills and god skills — and even unlock the second kind of combat modes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/a3d4b874e32652fc136ecb5fa50664c6.poster.avif?t=1793755280\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/a3d4b874e32652fc136ecb5fa50664c6.webm?t=1793755280\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/a3d4b874e32652fc136ecb5fa50664c6.mp4?t=1793755280\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies are immensely powerful, but with your skill and determination, you will overcome them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/04f835e4a8b8835bc837e5ed3b4de7cc.poster.avif?t=1793755280\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/04f835e4a8b8835bc837e5ed3b4de7cc.webm?t=1793755280\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/extras\/04f835e4a8b8835bc837e5ed3b4de7cc.mp4?t=1793755280\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Green Field Cube Island is a 3D action RPG. Step into the role of Chodnii, cross the mysterious teleportation portals scattered across Cube Island, explore wildly different worlds, hone your skills, defeat dangerous enemies, and ultimately find a way to escape Cube Island.","supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/1543a811b2465196e0c6cfd7ab92bd75ef1641ee\/header.jpg?t=1793755280","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/1cf824c2eb1378866e10643b426d5881c584a069\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793755280","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4587130\/1cf824c2eb13